{"seq":2,"slug":"lineage","title":"Lineage","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/influence-and-legacy/lineage","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"plato-and-aristotle","title":"柏拉图与亚里士多德","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/influence-and-legacy/lineage/plato-and-aristotle","wordCount":2624,"readingTime":11},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-hellenistic-schools","title":"希腊化诸学派","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/influence-and-legacy/lineage/the-hellenistic-schools","wordCount":2265,"readingTime":10}],"introHtml":"<p>本章呈现苏格拉底思想的传承谱系。从苏格拉底，到柏拉图，再到亚里士多德——这一三代相承的师徒谱系，奠定了西方哲学的根基；而希腊化时期的斯多葛、伊壁鸠鲁等诸学派，也都在不同程度上继承着苏格拉底的精神。本章揭示苏格拉底作为西方哲学众多传统之共同源头的深远影响。</p>\n"}